# Tribunal "An Attack on Mournhold": the day after Almalexia takes the Mazed Band,
# with the player away from the Plaza Brindisi Dorom, the fabricants attack
# (TribFabAttackCheck sets FabAttack). In the plaza they come out and fight the
# guards (fab_attack_1: 10; the Royal Guard and High Ordinator shouts: 20, 25).
# Four hulking and four verminous fabricants dead log 30 (TribFabAttackCheck),
# and Tienius Delitian's greeting logs 110.
# The player sleeps in Ebonheart's Underground Caves, an hour at a time, until
# the attack comes. The kills stand in for the fight. Ref FormIDs carry
# Tribunal.esm's slot 06 and Morrowind.esm's 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tr_mazed_band --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tr_mh_attack
run
player->PositionCell -210 1800 760 0 "Ebonheart, Underground Caves"
until 300 GetPCCell "Ebonheart, Underground Caves" == 1
rest 60 05554237 FabAttack == 1
defend
run
player->PositionCell 0 0 200 0 "Mournhold, Plaza Brindisi Dorom"
until 300 GetPCCell "Mournhold, Plaza Brindisi Dorom" == 1
until 600 GetJournalIndex TR_MHAttack >= 10
wait 300
console 063EC344.kill
console 0691F9EF.kill
console 066CE6B5.kill
console 06BD20DC.kill
console 06939550.kill
console 06729D21.kill
console 065E8872.kill
console 06E6C5B7.kill
until 600 GetJournalIndex TR_MHAttack == 30
run
player->PositionCell 193 -138 -90 0 "Mournhold, Royal Palace Throne Room"
until 600 "Tienius Delitian"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Tienius Delitian
expect GetJournalIndex TR_MHAttack == 110
bye
end
